                            %mo ,
                            %mi ω
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathcal{L}_{\omega_1,\omega}
              %strong 372
              (2019) pp. 8955-8983 .
          %p
            An approach which reframes conceptual completeness in terms of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/logical+schemes"} logical schemes
            is adopted in section 4.4 of
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Spencer+Breiner"}> Spencer Breiner
              ,
              = succeed "," do
